5:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-[640px] space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-slate","children":[["$","p","Most logo tools give FiveM owner",{"children":"Most logo tools give FiveM owners the same dead end: generic gaming templates that have nothing to do with roleplay, or a wolf-head mascot already used by forty other communities. Neva Design is a FiveM logo maker built around description instead of templates. You explain your city — its era, its energy, the story your server tells — and the AI composes an emblem that belongs to it: a municipal crest, a chrome wordmark, a mascot with actual character. You refine by chatting, not by re-opening a ticket, and export at up to 8K for anything from a Discord icon to printed merch. Real delivered logos sit in the portfolio at /neva-design if you want proof before starting. Signing up costs nothing and needs no credit card, so you can compare two directions before picking a plan."}]]}]
